{
  "Certain skills can deal Ice TECHNICAL. At the start of your turn, gain $1 stack of [Extinguishing Power]. When spending [Extinguishing Power], inflict all foes with $3 stack of [Drowning] for every $2 stack of [Extinguishing Power] spent.": "",
