  "Echoing Tide Lv.$1": "",
  "Echoing Tide <color=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color>": "",
  "Gain $1 [Extinguishing Power] stack, and deal Ice damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK, with a $3 base chance to inflict <link=\"s|103\"><u>Freeze</u></link> and decrease DEF by <color=#FFFC40>$4</color> for $8 turns (for every $5 of Natsukawa's Ailment ACC, decrease DEF by $6 more, up to a maximum of <color=#FFFC40>$7</color>). When an ally attacks a foe with this effect, increase TECHNICAL Mastery by <color=#FFFC40>$9</color>. If at least 1 foe is inflicted with <link=\"s|102\"><u>Burn</u></link>, remove their <link=\"s|102\"><u>Burn</u></link> and inflict [Fading Flame] on all foes ([Fading Flame] cannot activate this effect).\\n[Fading Flame]: Counts as <link=\"s|102\"><u>Burn</u></link>. Lasts for $10 turns. When allies attack the affected foe, increase <link=\"s|233\"><u>TECHNICAL Mastery</u></link> by <color=#FFFC40>$11</color>.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>Water drops fall into the swirling sea, creating ripples. The gentle waves turn into surging waves that hit the foe hard, causing impact and damage.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Binding Wave Lv.$1": "",
  "Binding Wave <color=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color>": "",
  "Deal Ice damage to 1 foe equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK, and can activate <link=\"s|229\"><u>Ice TECHNICAL</u></link>. When <link=\"s|231\"><u>[Ice Seal]</u></link> is activated, increase <link=\"s|231\"><u>[Ice Seal]</u></link> base chance to <color=#FFFC40>$2</color>.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>The distant waves freeze for a moment, then suddenly break apart, impacting to dismantle the foe's defense, unstoppable and inescapable.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Bursting Waterfall Lv.$1": "",
  "Bursting Waterfall <color=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color>": "",
  "Can be used at $1 or more [Extinguishing Power] stacks.\\nSpend $2 [Extinguishing Power] stacks to deal Ice damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> of ATK. Decrease DEF by <color=#FFFC40>$4</color> for $8 turns (for every $5 of Natsukawa's Ailment ACC, decrease DEF by $6 more, up to a maximum of <color=#FFFC40>$7</color>). Also activate <link=\"s|229\"><u>Ice TECHNICAL</u></link>. When <link=\"s|227\"><u>[Ice Burn]</u></link> is activated, this effect is guaranteed to evolve to [Cold Flames].\\n[Cold Flames]: Increase DMG Taken by <color=#FFFC40>$9</color> (for every $10 of Natsukawa's Ailment ACC, increase DMG Taken by $11 more, up to a maximum of <color=#FFFC40>$12</color>).\\nAt $13 or more [Extinguishing Power] stacks, evolve this skill to [Bursting Tornado].\\n[Bursting Tornado]: Spend $14 [Extinguishing Power] stacks to deal Ice damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$15</color> of ATK. Decrease DEF by <color=#FFFC40>$16</color> for $20 turns (for every $17 of Natsukawa's Ailment ACC, decrease DEF by $18 more, up to a maximum of <color=#FFFC40>$19</color>). Also activate <link=\"s|229\"><u>Ice TECHNICAL</u></link>. When <link=\"s|227\"><u>[Ice Burn]</u></link> is activated, this effect is guaranteed to evolve to [Cold Flames].\\n[Cold Flames]: Increase DMG Taken by <color=#FFFC40>$21</color> (for every $22 of Natsukawa's Ailment ACC, increase DMG Taken by $23 more, up to a maximum of <color=#FFFC40>$24</color>).\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>Water tornadoes erupted, spinning columns of water roaring across the sky and earth, transforming into razor-sharp icy prongs that pierced straight through the foe's flesh and blood with a single command.</color></size></b>": "",
  "[HIGHLIGHT]: Deal Ice damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK, and increase their DMG Taken for $5 turns (for every $2 of Natsukawa's Ailment ACC, increase DMG Taken by $3 more, up to a maximum of <color=#FFFC40>$4</color>) Also activate <link=\"s|229\"><u>Ice TECHNICAL</u></link>. When <link=\"s|231\"><u>[Ice Seal]</u></link> is activated, increase <link=\"s|231\"><u>[Ice Seal]</u></link> base chance to $6. Increase DMG Taken for foes inflicted with <link=\"s|214\"><u>Ice Seal</u></link> by this HIGHLIGHT (for every $7 of Natsukawa's ailment accuracy, increase DMG Taken by $8, up to a maximum of <color=#FFFC40>$9</color>). Then, deal bonus Ice damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$10</color> of ATK.\\n[ONE MORE]: Deal Ice damage to 1 foe. \\nMelee Attack: Uses a melee weapon to deal light Phys damage to 1 foe. \\nGun Attack: Gun Attack: Deal Gun damage to 1 foe $11 times. Can fire until out of ammo.": "",
