  "r:\"Gain (.+?) Extinguish stack, and deal Ice damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Attack\\. (.+?)% chance to inflict <link\\=(.+?)><u>Freeze</u></link>\\.\\nAlso, decrease Defense by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> for (\\d+) turns \\(for every (.+?)% of Natsukawa's ailment accuracy, decrease Defense by 1% more, up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color>\\)\\. When an ally attacks a foe whose Defense has been decreased by this skill, increase <link\\=(.+?)><u>Technical Precision</u></link> by <color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+)</color>\\.\\nIf at least (\\d+) foe is inflicted with <link\\=(.+?)><u>Burn</u></link>, remove Burn and inflict Scald on all foes \\(cannot be inflicted if Scald is already active\\)\\.\\nScald: Counts as Burn\\. Lasts for (\\d+) turns\\. When allies attack the affected foe, increase Technical Precision by <color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+)</color>\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>(.+?)</color></size></b>\"": "",
