  "r:\"Can be used at (\\d+) or more Extinguish stacks\\. Spend (\\d+) Extinguish stacks to deal Ice damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Attack\\. Also, decrease Defense by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> for (\\d+) turns \\(for every (.+?)% of Natsukawa's ailment accuracy, decrease Defense by 1% more, up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color>\\)\\.\\nAlso, can activate <link\\=(.+?)><u>Ice Technical</u></link>\\. When <link\\=(.+?)><u>Iceburn</u></link> is activated, this effect is guaranteed to evolve to Cold Flames\\.\\nCold Flames: Increase damage taken by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> \\(for every (.+?)% of Natsukawa's ailment accuracy, increase damage taken by 1% more, up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color>\\)\\.\\nAt (\\d+) or more Extinguish stacks, evolve this skill to Requiem Guidance\\.\\nSpend (\\d+) Extinguish stacks to deal Ice damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Attack\\. Also, decrease Defense by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> for (\\d+) turns \\(for every (.+?)% of Natsukawa's ailment accuracy, decrease Defense by 1% more, up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color>\\)\\.\\nAlso, can activate Ice Technical\\. When Iceburn is activated, this effect is guaranteed to evolve to Cold Flames\\.\\nCold Flames: Increase damage taken by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> \\(for every (.+?)% of Natsukawa's ailment accuracy, increase damage taken by 1% more, up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color>\\)\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>(.+?)</color></size></b>\"": "",
  "r:\"Highlight：Deal Ice damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Attack, and increase their damage taken for (\\d+) turns \\(for every (.+?)% of Natsukawa's ailment accuracy, increase damage taken by 1% more, up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color>\\)\\.\\nAlso, can activate <link\\=(.+?)><u>Ice Technical</u></link>\\. When <link\\=(.+?)><u>Deepfreeze</u></link> is activated, (\\d+)% chance to inflict <link\\=(.+?)><u>Icebound</u></link>\\. Also, increase damage taken by enemies inflicted with Freeze by this Highlight \\(for every (.+?)% of Natsukawa's ailment accuracy, increase damage taken by 1%, up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color>\\)\\.\\nThen, deal additional Ice damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Attack\\.\\n1 MORE：Deal Ice damage to 1 foe\\.\\nMelee Attack：Deal Physical damage to 1 foe\\.\\nRanged Attack：Deal Gun damage to 1 foe\\. Fire (\\d+) shots at once, and can fire until out of ammo\\.\"": "",
